{"status":{"visible":{"type":0,"list_id":0},"created_at":"Sat Aug 29 22:22:46 +0800 2026","id":"5337377263585455","mid":"5337377263585455","can_edit":false,"text":"收拾好状态，终于和大家见面了，希望今天短暂的相遇，能让大家都不再有烦恼。\n\n落地这座温热的城市，站在舞台上看见大家满目星光，喊出我名字的瞬间，我心里是真的真的很感动。隔着人海与灯火，看着奔赴而来的你们，我真切感受到，所有奔赴与热爱，从来都是双向的奔赴。谢谢你们愿意奔赴异国，把最热烈的掌声、最纯粹的偏爱，悉数赠予我，这是非常沉甸甸的喜欢。\n\n今天在曼谷的每一分、每一秒，我都会好好珍藏，这些都会成为我记忆里最珍贵的限定碎片。是你们，让我的每一次远行都有意义。那……下一场山海，让我们继续双向奔赴。\n\n回程的路上也请大家注意安全，记得报备哦～\n演员刘轩丞#刘轩丞丞长没烦恼#","textLength":571,"source":"","favorited":false,"pic_ids":["008CV3VQgy1igl2el7eg9j33ls5eoe85","008CV3VQgy1igl2ds19qcj33ls5eou11","008CV3VQgy1igl2dy4vk8j33ls5eohdv","008CV3VQgy1igl2efwbsvj33ls5eo7wm","008CV3VQgy1igl2duw362j32gw1n91ky","008CV3VQgy1igl2f26aoyj32ti42mkjm","008CV3VQgy1igl2e1dt3wj33ls5hv4qv","008CV3VQgy1igl2e3vqicj32og3lse83","008CV3VQgy1igl2e8501wj33ls5eoe86"],"thumbnail_pic":"https://wx4.sinaimg.cn/thumbnail/008CV3VQgy1igl2el7eg9j33ls5eoe85.jpg","bmiddle_pic":"http://wx4.sinaimg.cn/bmiddle/008CV3VQgy1igl2el7eg9j33ls5eoe85.jpg","original_pic":"https://wx4.sinaimg.cn/large/008CV3VQgy1igl2el7eg9j33ls5eoe85.jpg","is_paid":false,"mblog_vip_type":0,"user":{"id":7904163238,"screen_name":"刘轩丞-","profile_image_url":"https://tvax1.sinaimg.cn/crop.0.0.1080.1080.180/008CV3VQly8hmwhfa7n3gj30u00u0q43.jpg?KID=imgbed,tva&Expires=1788195308&ssig=d8PE5r64p2","profile_url":"https://m.weibo.cn/u/7904163238?launchid=10000360-page_H5","close_blue_v":false,"description":"新人演员#刘轩丞                                                                工作联系：leyi@leyi666.com","follow_me":false,"following":true,"follow_count":15,"followers_count":"188万","cover_image_phone":"https://wx3.sinaimg.cn/crop.0.0.640.640.640/008CV3VQly1hmwitpy729j30s50s5dkr.jpg","avatar_hd":"https://wx1.sinaimg.cn/orj480/008CV3VQly8hmwhfa7n3gj30u00u0q43.jpg","badge":{"user_name_certificate":1,"iplocationchange_2022":1,"user_identity_auth":1,"hpg_2025":1,"guoqing_2025":1,"lzly_2026":1,"yjdk_2026":1},"statuses_count":186,"verified":true,"verified_type":0,"gender":"m